<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,172 in June.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,172 in June.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wage in the enterprise sector rose to 1,172 zlotys in June from 1,100 zlotys in May, and was 27.1 percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	  JUNE	MAY	  JUNE 1996</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN	1,172     1,100	   922</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
